{"version":1,"settings":{"newPerDay":50,"reviewLimit":50,"fetchLongman":true,"againMinutes":10,"efMax":2.8,"hardFactor":1.2,"easyFactor":1.3,"autoMasterDays":0},"words":[{"id":"wmvp8kj20dvdxu","term":"situate","key":"situate","userDef":"义：使位于；使处于某种背景或环境中。常用被动 be situated in/on/at。例：The town is situated at the junction of three provinces.（小镇位于三省交界处）也可说 situate a story in the 1930s，把故事设定在 20 世纪 30 年代。","createdAt":1793017911672,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911672},{"id":"wmvp8kj20cicer","term":"junction","key":"junction","userDef":"义：交汇处；交叉点；连接处。搭配：at the junction of A and B。例：at the junction of three provinces 位于三省交界处。也可指道路、铁路的交汇点。","createdAt":1793017911673,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911673},{"id":"wmvp8kj20a68y7","term":"converge","key":"converge","userDef":"义：汇聚；交会；趋于一致。搭配：converge at/on。例：The three borders converge here.（三条边界在此交会）抽象用法：Their opinions converged. 意见趋于一致。","createdAt":1793017911674,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911674},{"id":"wmvp8kj20iglen","term":"glisten","key":"glisten","userDef":"义：闪亮；泛着微光，常因水分、湿润表面或光线反射而发亮。搭配：glistening water / a glistening river。常有湿润、清亮的视觉效果。","createdAt":1793017911675,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911675},{"id":"wmvp8kj2021olq","term":"glitter","key":"glitter","userDef":"义：闪闪发光；闪耀，通常突出许多明亮、醒目的光点。例：The stars glittered in the sky.（星星在天空中闪烁）也可指浮华、表面光鲜：the glitter of fame。","createdAt":1793017911676,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"i