,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911681},{"id":"wmvp8kj200zu0v","term":"ferry","key":"ferry","userDef":"义：渡船；渡运服务；渡运。可作名词或动词：take the ferry 乘渡船；ferry passengers across the river 把乘客渡送到河对岸。","createdAt":1793017911682,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911682},{"id":"wmvp8kj205bdes","term":"ferryboat","key":"ferryboat","userDef":"义：渡船，尤指用于运送乘客或车辆横渡水域的船。辨：与 ferry 意义重叠，但 ferry 更灵活，也能指整个渡运服务；普通行文中往往不必特意用 ferryboat。","createdAt":1793017911683,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911683},{"id":"wmvp8kj20itk94","term":"ferryman","key":"ferryman","userDef":"义：摆渡人；渡船船夫。传统语境中常指负责操船、把人渡过河的人。","createdAt":1793017911684,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911684},{"id":"wmvp8kj205of2t","term":"boatman","key":"boatman","userDef":"义：船夫；操船的人。辨：范围比 ferryman 广，不一定专门从事摆渡。","createdAt":1793017911685,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911685},{"id":"wmvp8kj2062cp2","term":"tend","key":"tend","userDef":"义：照料；看管；料理；照管。搭配：tend a garden / tend livestock / tend the ferry。辨：tend the ferry 可以表示看管渡船，但不一定明确表示实际操船。","createdAt":1793017911686,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911686},{"id":"wmvp8kj204g45w","term":"ply","key":"ply","userDef":"义：定期往返；在固定航线上运营；从事某种活动。例：Ferries ply between the two banks.（渡船往返于两岸）强调规律性、持续性的运输活动。","createdAt":1793017911687,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911687},{"id":"wmvp8kj20o6eyw","term":"shuttle","key":"shuttle","userDef":"义：在两地之间往返运送；穿梭。例：The boat shuttles passengers between the two banks.（小船往返于两岸运送乘客）强调反复接送。","createdAt":1793017911688,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911688},{"id":"wmvp8kj20eqhz5","term":"glide","key":"glide","userDef":"义：平稳、轻柔地滑行。例：The ferry glided across the river.（渡船平稳地滑过河面）突出运动的流畅、轻盈，而不是固定航线。","createdAt":1793017911689,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911689},{"id":"wmvp8kj20qma3q","term":"undercurrent","key":"undercurrent","userDef":"义：暗流；潜流；潜在的情绪、趋势或影响。搭配：an undercurrent beneath the surface 表面之下的暗流。比喻用法：an undercurrent of tension 潜藏的紧张气氛。","createdAt":1793017911690,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911690},{"id":"wmvp8kj20977om","term":"stealthy","key":"stealthy","userDef":"义：秘密的；悄无声息的；不易察觉的。搭配：a stealthy movement / a stealthy approach。强调行动隐蔽，常带有谨慎、秘密甚至鬼祟的意味。","createdAt":1793017911691,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911691},{"id":"wmvp8kj20htf7h","term":"stir","key":"stir","userDef":"义：搅动；微微移动；激起情绪或反应。例：The wind stirred the leaves.（风吹动了树叶）stir emotions 激起情绪。也可指某种力量开始活动：Something was stirring beneath the surface。","createdAt":1793017911692,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911692},{"id":"wmvp8kj20uin5s","term":"stir up","key":"stir up","userDef":"义：搅起；激起；挑起；煽动。搭配：stir up trouble / anger / controversy 惹起麻烦、激起愤怒、引发争议。辨：比单独的 stir 更常强调引发某种反应或使局势变得不平静。","createdAt":1793017911693,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911693},{"id":"wmvp8kj20szlk6","term":"move","key":"move","userDef":"此义 = progress。义：发展；推进；演变；运行。例：Events are moving quickly.（事态进展很快）History moves on. 历史继续向前发展。辨：Fate moves beneath the surface 是文学性的拟人表达，不是 move = progress 在所有语境中都能互换。","createdAt":1793017911694,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911694},{"id":"wmvp8kj20d33yk","term":"woodland sprite","key":"woodland sprite","userDef":"义：林间精灵；森林中的小精灵。sprite 指精灵、仙灵，常用于奇幻或文学语境。例：a girl as free-spirited as a woodland sprite（一个像林间精灵般自由灵动的女孩）","createdAt":1793017911695,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911695},{"id":"wmvp8kj20q5mak","term":"forthright","key":"forthright","userDef":"义：直率的；坦诚的；直截了当的。搭配：a forthright person / a forthright manner。强调说话、表达态度时坦率直接，通常是正面评价。","createdAt":1793017911696,"srs":{"ef":2.5,"interval":0,"reps":0,"lapses":0,"due":1793017911672,"lastGrade":null,"lastReview":null,"history":[]},"mastered":false,"deleted":false,"status":"new","updatedAt":1793017911696},{"id":"wmvp8kj202pr9m","term":"hearty","key":"hearty","userDef":"义：热情友好的；爽朗的；衷心的；丰盛的。搭配：a hearty welcome / hearty laughter / a hearty meal。辨：形容人时可指热情、爽朗，但不等于“豪爽”的全部含义。","createdAt":17930